agraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.avif?t=1761713301\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras_big/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.webp?t=1761713301 width=1600 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Facing the Apocalypse's Trials - Can You Last Till Dawn?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Biting Cold</strong>: Your tropical hometown Marina Bay has inexplicably plunged below zero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Zombie Onslaught</strong>: The cold slows them down... but you too... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humanity Test</strong>: Former neighbors may prove deadlier than the undead!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>\u300aSUBZERO\u300b\u00a0</i>is a live-action interactive movie game where critical choices or dice rolls determine the story's course.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decisions affect relationships, unlocking branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategically nurture bonds and manage dice modifiers to reach wildly different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/03aaacd7dcc0721004be8eb90ee144f3.avif?t=1761713301\" width=648 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The Dice Decides Your Fate! Try Your Luck! </i></strong> <br>\u00a0<strong><i>--Your next roll could be your final breath!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Choose Wisely!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choices impact both affinity AND die modifiers (bonus/penalty)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/3649d8501cf3fc00debd43270af780b5.avif?t=1761713301\" width=463 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Soon, every choice you make... will become ice picks stabbing your conscience</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.avif?t=1761713301\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras_big/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.webp?t=1761713301 width=1600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Ultimate Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Video Specs:</strong> 1080P, 30,000 kbps bitrate, 50 FPS cinematics for smoother action sequences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perspective:</strong> An 80% first-person and 20% third-person narrative blend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio:</strong> Recorded with live sound (on-set audio).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/93e46b3f54f27ad6adb4b93fc78b2118.poster.avif?t=1761713301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam